From: Pavel Khmelinsky <hmepas@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:41:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/14] Adapt the patch to release-10.10

React 17 has no useSyncExternalStore, so a small hook stands in for it. The sidebar uses
react-beautiful-dnd and react-custom-scrollbars, WithTooltip lives in components/, and tests
use enzyme and @testing-library/react-hooks. Snapshots gain the latest messages button and
the fragment around the channel icon that holds the team badge.
